#: lib/pauseai_ca_web/live/protest_press_release_live.ex:108
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In just a few years, AI systems have gone from clumsy chatbots to systems capable of hacking some of the most sophisticated computer networks. Where is this trajectory taking us? We need to give ourselves more time to learn how to control AI systems before making them even more powerful. A pause is necessary."
